\/timeouts notzero. Long multi-table snapshot notdefault; eachcount has its own time unless isolated fixedrestore. TDE server must possess needed decryptcapability, SQL client neednot knowkey\/seed; restored encryptedbackup requires administrator\/key handling. Appcipher rowcount needsnot plaintext; unreadable\/noSQL case cannot be counted this way.\nCalibration companion: how few representative fixtures should be chosen from observable rowcount\/rowbytes\/columncount\/index\/PK\/encryption\/stat-age\/change\/skew\/samplepages. Use existing58metadata accuracy cases,100Mthin and750k50\/100TDE plus105static\/48service only as bounded evidence. 100M80columnsTDE is NOT measured; cannot infer cost\/storage fromcolumncount alone. Explain how operator obtains approximate rowwidth\/allocatedbytes and matches a measured profile, when to reject the calibration, and how to compare statistics with exacttruth on a nonproduction measurementDB. Statsage,MODIFIED_COUNTER,samplepages help diagnose but do NOT yield distribution-free error bars; INNODB_TABLESTATS requiresPROCESS so optionaladmincheck, no privilege escalation default. TABLE_ROWS\/SHOWTABLESTATUS\/n_rows\/EXPLAIN often share stats, agreement is not independent validation. More samplepages\/ANALYZE cancostIO and neednot monotonically improve an individual estimate; onlycalibrate offproduction. Provide clear acceptance\/reject\/routing rules tied to measured conditions; don't merely say everythingdepends.\nSelected evidence: results\/reference\/20261107-observations\/requested_metadata_accuracy.json (147KB): beforeTABLE_ROWS58cases medianabs.208%,max15.035%,57\/58within10%; afterANALYZEmax23.123%; uneven2.1M-row case default20pages5runs4.56–38.731%errors,200pages5runs-2.131%,2000pages-2.131to-2.812%. Verify these selected facts fromfile beforecitation. All are historical fixedsnapshot observations, not futurecoverage guarantees. Other source: results\/reference\/review-20261107T123436Z-66065\/manifest.json currentpartial3